    {
      "external_id": "slack:C02:1770832920.000100",
      "kind": "slack_message",
      "url": "https://lakeshore-vision.example/slack/archives/C02/p1770832920000100",
      "author": "li.w",
      "created_at": "2026-02-11T18:02:00.000Z",
      "body": "PTQ is a bust for small defects. 41 ms but we lose 23 points of mAP on the under-8 px bucket. The papers we based this on only report classification.",
      "channel": "ml-edge",
      "parent": null
    },
    {
      "external_id": "slack:C02:1770833700.000100",
      "kind": "slack_message",
      "url": "https://lakeshore-vision.example/slack/archives/C02/p1770833700000100",
      "author": "omar.k",
      "created_at": "2026-02-11T18:15:00.000Z",
      "body": "Expected something but not that much. Want me to try pruning so we stay FP32?",
      "channel": "ml-edge",
      "parent": "1770832920.000100"
    },
    {
      "external_id": "slack:C02:1770835200.000100",
      "kind": "slack_message",
      "url": "https://lakeshore-vision.example/slack/archives/C02/p1770835200000100",
      "author": "priya.n",
      "created_at": "2026-02-11T18:40:00.000Z",
      "body": "Yes. And Li, can you write up a QAT plan with distillation? Nobody seems to have published QAT numbers for tiny-object detectors on CPU-only ARM, so we have to find out.",
      "channel": "ml-edge",
      "parent": "1770832920.000100"
    },
    {
      "external_id": "slack:C02:1772809920.000100",
      "kind": "slack_message",
      "url": "https://lakeshore-vision.example/slack/archives/C02/p1772809920000100",
      "author": "omar.k",
      "created_at": "2026-03-06T15:12:00.000Z",
      "body": "Pruning results: 88 ms at 50%, 61 ms at 70% but mAP 86.2. Not going to make 50 ms this way.",
      "channel": "ml-edge",
      "parent": null
    },
    {
      "external_id": "slack:C02:1772811000.000100",
      "kind": "slack_message",
      "url": "https://lakeshore-vision.example/slack/archives/C02/p1772811000000100",
      "author": "sam.r",
      "created_at": "2026-03-06T15:30:00.000Z",
      "body": "OK. Let's put everything on QAT. If QAT fails too we tell the two pilot customers they need the GPU box.",
      "channel": "ml-edge",
      "parent": "1772809920.000100"
    },
    {
      "external_id": "slack:C02:1775241000.000100",
      "kind": "slack_message",
      "url": "https://lakeshore-vision.example/slack/archives/C02/p1775241000000100",
      "author": "li.w",
      "created_at": "2026-04-03T18:30:00.000Z",
      "body": "QAT + distillation run 4: 46 ms, 91.8 mAP. First time we are under 50 ms and within a point of baseline.",
      "channel": "ml-edge",
      "parent": null
    },
    {
      "external_id": "slack:C02:1776703500.000100",
      "kind": "slack_message",
      "url": "https://lakeshore-vision.example/slack/archives/C02/p1776703500000100",
      "author": "omar.k",
      "created_at": "2026-04-20T16:45:00.000Z",
      "body": "Heads up: under continuous load the board throttles to 58 ms after 2 hours. Heatsink rev + 3 threads holds 48 ms for 8 hours.",
      "channel": "ml-edge",
      "parent": null
    },
    {
      "external_id": "slack:C03:1774026600.000100",
      "kind": "slack_message",
      "url": "https://lakeshore-vision.example/slack/archives/C03/p1774026600000100",
      "author": "mei.c",
      "created_at": "2026-03-20T17:10:00.000Z",
      "body": "Fine-tune on the chrome set is bad: recall 0.62, FPR 31%. The model calls every highlight a scratch.",
      "channel": "ml-research",
      "parent": null
    },
    {
      "external_id": "slack:C03:1774027800.000100",
      "kind": "slack_message",
      "url": "https://lakeshore-vision.example/slack/archives/C03/p1774027800000100",
      "author": "priya.n",
      "created_at": "2026-03-20T17:30:00.000Z",
      "body": "Not surprised. None of the few-shot papers test on specular surfaces. Let's see if synthetic highlights help.",
      "channel": "ml-research",
      "parent": "1774026600.000100"
    },
    {
      "external_id": "slack:C03:1780078200.000100",
      "kind": "slack_message",
      "url": "https://lakeshore-vision.example/slack/archives/C03/p1780078200000100",
      "author": "mei.c",
      "created_at": "2026-05-29T18:10:00.000Z",
      "body": "Masking + prototypical head: recall 0.81, FPR 9%. Masking is doing most of the work. Still short of 0.90 recall.",
      "channel": "ml-research",
      "parent": null
    },
    {
      "external_id": "slack:C03:1780131900.000100",
      "kind": "slack_message",
      "url": "https://lakeshore-vision.example/slack/archives/C03/p1780131900000100",
